{"ideviceId":"idevice-1771973374755-2l906d5qb","textInfoDurationInput":"","textInfoDurationTextInput":"Duración","textInfoParticipantsInput":"","textInfoParticipantsTextInput":"Agrupamiento","textTextarea":"<p>Para que practiques con matrices cualesquiera que tú te inventes y compruebes si el resultado que obtienes es correcto te ofrecemos la siguiente calculadora. Introduce matrices A y B y súmalas o réstalas. Comprueba que el resultado que has obtenido es el correcto pulsando sobre el botón inferior correspondiente a la operación que hayas efectuado.</p>
<style>
    .matrix-container {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .matrix-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-around;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .matrix-box {
        margin: 10px;
        padding: 15px;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }
    .matrix-box h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #2c3e50;
    }
    .matrix-grid {
        display: inline-grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 50px);
        gap: 5px;
        padding: 10px;
        border-left: 2px solid #333;
        border-right: 2px solid #333;
        border-radius: 15px / 40px;
    }
    .matrix-grid input {
        width: 45px;
        height: 35px;
        text-align: center;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 14px;
    }
    .matrix-grid input:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: #3498db;
        background-color: #ebf5fb;
    }
    .controls {
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 15px;
        border-top: 2px dashed #ddd;
    }
    .btn {
        padding: 10px 20px;
        margin: 5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        background-color: #3498db;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
        background-color: #2980b9;
    }
    .btn-clear {
        background-color: #e74c3c;
    }
    .btn-clear:hover {
        background-color: #c0392b;
    }
</style>
<div class="matrix-container">
<h2 style="color: #2c3e50;">Calculadora de Matrices</h2>
<div class="matrix-wrapper">
<div class="matrix-box">
<h3>Matriz A</h3>
<form id="mA">
<div class="matrix-grid"><input type="text" name="a11" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a12" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a13" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a21" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a22" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a23" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a31" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a32" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a33" value="0" /></div>
<br /><br /><input type="reset" value="Limpiar A" class="btn btn-clear" /></form></div>
<div class="matrix-box">
<h3>Matriz B</h3>
<form id="mB">
<div class="matrix-grid"><input type="text" name="a11" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a12" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a13" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a21" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a22" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a23" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a31" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a32" value="0" /> <input type="text" name="a33" value="0" /></div>
<br /><br /><input type="reset" value="Limpiar B" class="btn btn-clear" /></form></div>
<div class="matrix-box">
<h3>Matriz C</h3>
<form id="mC">
<div class="matrix-grid"><input type="text" name="a11" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a12" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a13" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a21" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a22" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a23" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a31" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a32" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /> <input type="text" name="a33" readonly="readonly" style="background: #f0f0f0;" /></div>
<br /><br /><input type="reset" value="Limpiar C" class="btn btn-clear" /></form></div>
</div>
<div class="controls"><input type="button" value="Sumar (A + B = C)" class="btn" onclick="operate('add')" /> <input type="button" value="Restar (A - B = C)" class="btn" onclick="operate('rest')" /></div>
</div>
<p>
<script>
function operate(type) {
    const fA = document.getElementById('mA');
    const fB = document.getElementById('mB');
    const fC = document.getElementById('mC');

    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
        for (let j = 1; j <= 3; j++) {
            let field = "a" + i + j;
            let valA = parseFloat(fA[field].value) || 0;
            let valB = parseFloat(fB[field].value) || 0;

            if (type === 'add') {
                fC[field].value = (valA + valB).toFixed(2).replace(/\.00$/, '');
            } else {
                fC[field].value = (valA - valB).toFixed(2).replace(/\.00$/, '');
            }
        }
    }
}
</script>
</p>","textFeedbackInput":"Mostrar retroalimentación","textFeedbackTextarea":""}

